**🧧 Supported Versions:**
- 1.21.10
- 1.21.11 *[LTS]*
- 26.1 *[LTS]*
- 26.1.1 & 26.1.2
- 26.2
- 26.3

**🔌 Supported ModLoaders:**
- Fabric
- NeoForge
- Sponge
- Paper

**🪵 Changelog:**
- Add the missing World methods to Paper
- Fix. Ultra stupid. 1.21.11 releasing.
- [Client] Fix some methods being non-accessible
- [World API] Block highlighting
- [Server API] Mojang-based method variants
- Update to 26.3
- Remove Quilt support
- [Block API] #emitLight([BlockData] blockData)
- [Block API] #isSuffocating([BlockData] blockData, [World] world, [BlockPos] blockPos)
- [Block API] #isViewBlocking([BlockData] blockData, [World] world, [BlockPos] blockPos)
- [Block API] #isValidSpawn([BlockData] blockData, [World] world, [BlockPos] blockPos, [EntityType] entityType)
- [Block Creation API] Colored lightning

**🪵 Changelog (1.24-prerelease-1):**
- More friendly error message when a symbolic link mod file fails to resolve

